# Internal working documents, kept in their own PRIVATE git repository.
#
# Strategy, cross-repo state, and honest notes on what has not been tested.
# The same arrangement as the site repo, and for the same reason this repo's
# history was already reset once: none of it belongs in a public repository.
# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, `internal/` matches a directory
# of that name at ANY depth, which silently swallowed
# registry/sheet/src/internal/sheet/SheetShape.kt on 2026-08-16: it compiled
# locally, was never committed, and both CI jobs failed on an unresolved
# reference while two releases shipped green from the release workflow, which
# does not compile the harness.
#
# The six older components survived only because their internal/ files were
# committed BEFORE this line existed, and git keeps tracking what is already in
# the index. Every component added after it would have hit the same wall.
/internal/
